═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
💡 SELECTION MANTRAS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. "Option numbers first" → Accept 1, 2, 3, etc. as direct references
2. "Exact time is clear" → Accept 14:00, 14:30, etc. without ambiguity
3. "am/pm solves everything" → Accept 5pm, 2:30am, etc.
4. "Always confirm" → After interpreting, confirm the selection

